  },
  {
    "insert": "In general, ensuring academic tone gives the text more credibility. It is highly recommended to avoid subjective tone and to make strong statements. For example avoid subjective phrases like “We’ve also got some great data sources…” or “Our creative approach…” . By these improvements, your proposal becomes in a way more academical.\n(Content) - sections"
  },
  {
    "insert": "\n",
