    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "Aim of this lecture is learning how to write the proposal into clear sections, while adding a clear research question and sub-questions to focus the research objectives. However, the proposal lacks structured sections, a clearly defined research question. The theoretical framework is only implicitly referenced and requires explicit discussion. To improve the proposal, restructure it into separate sections for SOTA, Theoretical Framework etc. Introduce a clear research question, supported by sub-questions. Additionally, address potential challenges.\n"
